  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Education Knowledge Building and Research initiative aims to build capacity for research-based policy development in Australia and overseas and generate evidence to improve the effectiveness of aid to the education sector. This investment includes support to the Australian Council for Educational Research&apos;s (ACER) Centre for Global Education Monitoring (GEM) and a pilot early childhood development program.</narrative>
